e mages the strongest type  of mage there is but one of the  attackers stands out from the rest and  that is none other than the dark triad  member Vanek a-- and at this point it is  revealed that wanaka is the one who is  possessed by the demon makey Kula Noel  is startled immediately as soon as she  hears that name because she knows that  Mikiko  was the demon who cursed her mother as  you will recall  according to Dorothea Unsworth Noelle's  mother died as a direct result of Meggie  khulus curse and of course we know that  Meggie claw is also the demon who cursed  Laura Pacheco for those who weren't sure  whether the Spade Kingdom's power comes  from one overpowered demon or multiple  separate demons this chapter seems to  confirm that there are indeed multiple  different demons involved and so McGee  Kula is only one of them  it appears that every member of the dark  triad is being possessed by a different  demon and presumably there are even more  demons who are possessing the other zero  stage mages from the Spade Kingdom but  how many demons are there and how is it  possible that so many different demons  have popped up inside the Spade Kingdom  up to this point demon sightings were  extremely rare for over 200 chapters we  only had Asta's demon and a kotodama  demon and of course the kotodama demon  had been sealed away for five hundred  years before eventually making his  glorious comeback so how do we go from  demons being an extremely rare and  unnatural sight to what looks like  dozens of different demons actively  conspiring with the Spade Kingdom in  order to take down the heart clover  Alliance there is definitely something  going on inside the spade Kingdom that  we are still not aware of there has to  be some explanation for why so many  demons have appeared inside the spade  Kingdom at this exact time and why they  seem to be actively helping the spade  army I am very curious to find out what  exactly is going on behind the scenes  and if you happen to have any ideas of  your own feel free to let me know the  focus of this chapter then shifts to an  area near the Spade border where the  black bulls are currently located inside  their mobile base Austin FINRA returned  from the battlefield and they greet  Vanessa gray and Ghosh it turns out that  Yami is away from the base he is  actually at a captain's conference  inside the clover Kingdom and fennel  and bring him back to the base Gordon is  off somewhere studying curse magic and  Henry is there but he is taking a nap  Charmy is also away still back inside  the heart Kingdom with Noel as we saw  earlier in the chapter and Zora and  Magna are gone too but then just as we  get the general idea of where all the  black bowls are colonel  located Henri snaps awake from his nap  he calls to the others immediately  because he can sense that someone is  here suddenly they realized that their  entire massive hideout is floating in  the air and it turns out that this is  the work of Dante of the dark triad  Dante has arrived and he uses gravity  magic this unique magic attribute is  what allows him to make the entire  mobile base float Dante says that since  it appears that Yami is away he'll have  to play with the rest of the black balls  while waiting for Yami to come back the  black bull's spring into action right  away and Henry uses recombination magic  to transform the mobile base into its  mecha form the black balls launch a mana  rocket punch at Dante but he uses an  interestingly named spell to basically  destroy the attack in seconds the name  of Dante's spell is gravity magic  presence of the demon king this is a  very interesting detail because we know  that Dante wears that big crown so it's  fair to assume that he is the leader of  the dark triad but thus calling his  spell presence of the demon king mean  that he is just Tooting his own horn as  the king of the spade kingdom or is this  referring to the demon that is  possessing him is it possible that 