 war arc has now opened multiple  battle fronts and in the next few  chapters we can expect to see some truly  epic battles that may cement black  clovers position as a modern Shonen  classic we just said Zenon wrecking  havoc with the Golden Dawn and then  disappearing and going who knows where  now we have Vanek ax and Meggie Kula  attacking the Hart Kingdom and other top  tier mages seem to be attacking in  multiple places at once and we also have  Dante who is potentially the strongest  member of the dark triad attacking the  black Bulls right inside their own  headquarters I have to say that in terms  of hype and excitement this arc has  really been amazing and it has exceeded  my expectations after the big kotodama  fight I honestly didn't know where the  story would go from here I had no idea  how they were going to up the stakes  after such a powerful villain and a  villain who it turns out was responsible  for pretty much all of the major  conflicts in the story thus far  after that arch-villain was defeated I  was afraid that the story would lose its  charm where could they go from here  but I gotta give it to yuki Tabata and  his team they really succeeded in  keeping up the hype raising the stakes  even further and keeping me interested  in the story even after the kotodama  epicness  but let me know what you guys think is  Dante being possessed by the strongest  demon of all the demon king and if so  does this mean that we are about to see  a black bull death in the coming  chapters also how do you think Yami will  fare against Dante does he stand a  chance personally I think that even Yami  will need help from hasta and many of  his other teammates in order to stand a  chance against Dante based on the  information that we have so far feel  free to share your feedback down in the  comments below if you enjoyed this black  clover video and you want us to keep it  going please leave a like to let me know  and if you happen to be new to anime  uproar or y